# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，避免 Windows CRLF 混入
# 这个项目要在 Linux 容器里跑 .sh 脚本，CRLF 会导致 "bad interpreter"
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pth binary
*.pkl binary
*.npy binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.zip binary
